# One usecase per file

- Exactly one exported use case function per file in `features/<name>/usecases/`.
- File name: `<action>-<entity>.usecase.ts` (kebab-case, verb first — `create-user`, `list-roles`,
  `delete-organization`).
- A use case calls exactly one repository method. If an action genuinely needs two calls, that's a sign
  it belongs in the controller (orchestration) or the backend (a combined endpoint), not fused into one
  usecase file.
